  "prefLabel": "He-W 544.12 Utilization Review and Control",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-07-01",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 544.12 Utilization Review and Control. The department’s surveillance and utilization review of subsystems unit shall monitor utilization of hospice services in accordance with 42 CFR 455, 42 CFR 456, He-W 520, and documentation of hospice services as required by He-W 544.\n\nSource. #9726-A, eff 7-1-10, EXPIRED: 7-1-18\n\nNew. (See Revision Note at part heading for He-W 544) #13847, eff 1-6-24 (formerly He-W 544.11)",
